PulseOps contains modified, translated portions of DataCat at commit
c016efb70de792f5beeb7b2d1266830087910343:

- the Boolean search compiler from artifacts/api-server/src/query/search.ts
  (src/PulseOps.Server/EventSearch.cs);
- the incident recovery threshold from artifacts/api-server/src/jobs/monitors.ts
  (src/PulseOps.Server/Processing.cs);
- the mergeable log-scale latency histogram (bucketOf, valueOf, Hist) from
  artifacts/api-server/src/query/apmStats.ts, used for long-range rollups and
  monitor baselines (src/PulseOps.Server/Histogram.cs).

